  "content": "<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h5>\n<h5><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1097884561104441474/Prominence2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"552\" height=\"274\"></h5>\n<h5><br><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/elocindev/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=查看我的其他模組!&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=CurseForge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"203\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/prominence-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=1.19.2&amp;message=立即體驗PROMINENCE&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"255\" height=\"28\"></a></strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=贊助支持&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a></h5>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Prominent</strong> 是一個擴展 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/prominence-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prominence</a>&nbsp;模組包的附加模組，通過添加自定義內容、資源和修復來增強模組包體驗。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">不建議在Prominence模組包之外使用此模組，因其內容和資源設計需與模組包內特定模組互動才能完整發揮功能。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
